    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32292" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ŏdyssēa</span></b> , ae,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀδυσσεία</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The Odyssey of Homer</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. Tr. 2,
				375</span></i>.—Gr. acc. Odyssian, <i><span class="en">Varr. Sat. Men. 11, 14</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Petr. 29,
			4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A poem of Livius Andronicus</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Brut.
